{"t":"CNP","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"CenterPoint Energy, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":8794,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.centerpointenergy.com","summary_en":"CenterPoint Energy, Inc. operates as a public utility holding company in the United States. The company operates through Electric; Natural Gas; and Corporate and Other segments. The Electric segment provides electric transmission and distribution services to electric customers and electric generation assets, as well as optimizes assets in the wholesale power market in Indiana Electric's service territory. The Natural Gas segment engages in the intrastate natural gas sales, and natural gas transportation and distribution for residential, commercial, and industrial customers in Indiana, Minnesota, Ohio, and Texas; permanent pipeline connections through interconnects with various interstate and intrastate pipeline companies; and provides home appliance maintenance and repair services to customers in Minnesota and home repair protection plans to natural gas customers in Indiana, Mississippi, Ohio, and Texas through a third party. As of December 31, 2025, it served approximately 2,859,313 metered customers; owned 355 substations with transformer capacity of 81,692 megavolt amperes; and owned and operated approximately 208 miles of intrastate pipeline in Louisiana and Texas. The company was founded in 1866 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"CenterPoint Energy, Inc.는 미국에서 공공 유틸리티 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 회사는 Electric을 통해 운영됩니다. 천연가스; 기업 및 기타 부문. 전기 부문은 전기 고객 및 발전 자산에 송전 및 배전 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 Indiana Electric 서비스 영역의 도매 전력 시장에서 자산을 최적화합니다. 천연가스 부문은 인디애나, 미네소타, 오하이오 및 텍사스의 주거용, 상업용 및 산업 고객을 위한 주 내 천연가스 판매, 천연가스 운송 및 유통에 종사하고 있습니다. 다양한 주간 및 주 내 파이프라인 회사와의 상호 연결을 통한 영구 파이프라인 연결; 미네소타 고객에게 가전제품 유지보수 및 수리 서비스를 제공하고 제3자를 통해 인디애나, 미시시피, 오하이오, 텍사스의 천연가스 고객에게 주택 수리 보호 계획을 제공합니다. 2025년 12월 31일 기준으로 약 2,859,313명의 측정 고객에게 서비스를 제공했습니다. 81,692 메가볼트 암페어의 변압기 용량을 갖춘 355개의 변전소를 소유했습니다. 루이지애나와 텍사스에 약 208마일에 달하는 주 내 파이프라인을 소유하고 운영했습니다. 이 회사는 1866년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":39.97,"mcap":26495299584.0,"pe":22.971266,"fpe":19.097357,"peg":2.1545,"ps":2.6972718,"pb":2.2564073,"ev_ebitda":12.483,"div":2.4,"beta":0.421,"hi52":45.26,"lo52":36.37},"fin":{"rev":9822999552.0,"rev_g":0.102,"eps_g":0.114,"gross":0.48386002,"op":0.3026,"net":0.117580004,"roe":0.10142,"fcf":-4986250240.0,"cash":557000000.0,"debt":24903000064.0,"de":212.085,"eps":1.74,"feps":2.09296},"own":{"short":0.0911,"inst":1.06856,"insider":0.00236},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":44.23684,"median":44.0,"high":50.0,"low":39.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.09524,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":9,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":9,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":43.0,"priorPriceTarget":41.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":47.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":44.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":39.0,"priorPriceTarget":38.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":41.0,"priorPriceTarget